{"id":"0c5f4c3c-1309-4a95-93bd-34d1dc2ed8bd","object":"chat.completion","created":1793337085,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Writing the final report from the five topic notes, with one evidence entry per answer field.\n\n```python\nimport json\nreport = {\n  \"overview\": \"本文综述 Agentic LLM（arXiv:2503.23037v3，Plaat 等）。作者把智能体定义为接收自然语言输入、进行推理决策并自主行动以达成目标的 LLM 系统，并将能力划分为推理、行动、交互三大类，三者层层递进并形成 virtuous circle：推理技术支撑助手行动，助手交互能力支持社会模拟，模拟与行动数据又可用于微调推理模型。文献以 Google Scholar 检索起步，再用滚雪球法扩展，主要覆盖 2023–2025 年工作。论文依次讨论多步推理、自反思与检索增强，工具使用、机器人与助手，以及多智能体角色互动、社会模拟、辩论与协作，最后给出训练数据、幻觉、智能体行为、自反思与安全等研究议题。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"overview\",\n      \"summary\": \"论文的分类框架是 reasoning–acting–interacting：第一类推理包括多步推理、自反思与检索增强；第二类行动包括工具调用、机器人与各领域助手；第三类交互包括多智能体角色扮演、社会模拟与涌现行为。三类能力互相支撑：推理技术提升助手行动质量，助手的交互能力使社会实验成为可能，而行动与社会实验产生的数据又可回流用于微调，改进推理模型。文献组织上，作者先以 Google Scholar 检索，再用滚雪球法追踪被引工作，只收录基于 LLM 的 agentic 方法，非 agentic 的 LLM 工作仅作背景；局限是覆盖面受检索起点与时间窗口限制。\",\n      \"application\": \"我上次实现的 agent 已有版本化证据、按页批量选择、笔记复用、工具调用与 pytest 验证，属于分类框架中的“推理＋行动”。不足是没有真正的多智能体协作，也不会用交互数据回流训练。未来可尝试加入角色分工的多智能体讨论，以及把执行轨迹沉淀为可复用的反思笔记。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"categories\": [\"reason\", \"act\", \"interact\"],\n        \"search_methods\": [\"google_scholar_search\", \"snowballing\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"categories\", \"page\": 4, \"quote\": \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"search_methods\", \"page\": 5, \"quote\": \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reasoning\",\n      \"summary\": \"推理主题按多步推理、自反思、检索增强展开。Self Consistency 属于多路径集成方法：对同一问题采样多条不同推理路径，再对各路径结果做多数投票，选出最一致的答案，因此关键在于“投票”而非单条链的置信度。Tree of Thoughts 把推理组织为树，由外部控制算法反复以不同提示调用模型，一条路径走完后回溯尝试替代分支，论文给出广度优先与深度优先两种搜索控制器。自反思让模型评估自身预测并生成更好提示，Reflexion 等系统需要外部记忆；隐式推理则可把推理能力训练进模型，如 DeepSeek-R1。局限是长链推理仍可能累积幻觉。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单路径执行，没有对同一任务采样多条轨迹再投票，也没有显式的树搜索与回溯。可以改进为：对关键判断采样多次并按多数投票定稿，或在页面筛选时用广度优先探索候选批次、失败时回溯。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"self_consistency_selection\": \"majority voting\",\n        \"tot_search\": [\"breadth_first\", \"depth_first\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"self_consistency_selection\", \"page\": 10, \"quote\": \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"tot_search\", \"page\": 13, \"quote\": \"Here, an external control algorithm is created, that calls the model, each time with a different prompt, so that it follows a tree of reasoning steps. When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"工具使用属于行动类能力：模型通过调用外部服务扩展自身边界。Toolformer 以自监督方式让模型学会在文本中插入 API 调用，测试的工具包括计算器、问答系统、搜索引擎、翻译系统和日历，说明工具调用可由模型自行标注训练。ToolBench 则提供大规模 API 数据集，包含来自 RapidAPI 的 16,464 个公开 REST API，用于训练和评测多工具调用。文中还讨论计算机与浏览器工具、智能体互操作协议以及工具调用的安全风险，如恶意任务基准与对抗提示生成。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已通过命令工具真实调用 read_pdf.py 和 pytest，并把 command_result 完整保存，这正是工具使用的落地形式。不足之处是工具集合固定、没有按需发现新 API，也没有对工具返回做安全审查。未来可增加工具注册与自动选择，并对命令输出做校验与回退。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"toolformer_tools\": [\"calculator\", \"question_answering\", \"search_engine\", \"translation\", \"calendar\"],\n        \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"toolformer_tools\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"交互主题关注多个 LLM 智能体之间的自然语言通信：角色扮演、团队合作、博弈与社会模拟。CAMEL 用 inception prompt 指定用户与助手角色，让两个智能体在初始想法引导下保持身份并协作完成任务。Generative Agents 在角色之外加入记忆、计划与反思模块，产生可信的日常行为；其可信度由 100 名人类评估者判断。文中还介绍 Sotopia、GovSim 等社会目标与合作评测，以及用 1052 个访谈智能体复现问卷的千人模拟实验，观察到涌现行为，也观察到不稳定与幻觉。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单智能体流水线，尚未实现角色分工与消息交换，因此 multi-agent 只是未来建议。可先尝试两角色协作：一个负责页面筛选与笔记，一个负责核对引用与格式；但需注意多智能体也会带来不一致与幻觉。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"camel_prompting\", \"page\": 46, \"quote\": \"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\", \"page\": 47, \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"Table 4 把未来工作归为五个议题：训练数据、幻觉、智能体行为、自反思与安全。训练数据方面强调用推理期数据微调、稳定的强化学习以及多模态信号；幻觉方面主张自验证、机制可解释性与开放世界模型探索；智能体行为需要可扩展的模拟基础设施、角色扮演与社会行为建模；自反思指向模型内反思与元推理；安全则涉及助手的责任、隐私与公平。结论指出三类能力都受益于推理与自验证这两项基础能力，例如工具使用建立在有依据的检索增强之上，社会互动建立在自反思之上。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已有证据版本化与 pytest 验证，可视为初级的自验证；但缺少对生成报告的事实核验与不确定性标注。未来可在写报告后增加一次自动核对（答案—引文—页码一致性检查），并为高风险工具调用加人工确认。多智能体协作与训练数据回流仍属未来设想。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\"training_data\", \"hallucination\", \"agent_behavior\", \"self_reflection\", \"safety\"],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\"reasoning\", \"self_verification\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"agenda_topics\", \"page\": 51, \"quote\": \"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants\"},\n        {\"question\": \"shared_foundations\", \"page\": 52, \"quote\": \"Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\"}\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\nw = write_file('report.json', json.dumps(report, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), 'ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356')\nprint(w['rc'] if 'rc' in w else w)\n```","reasoning_content":"The report.json is empty {}. I need to build the report. Printing repr caused error due to forbidden function. Let me just print content directly.\n\nActually I already have the content: '{}'. Now I need to build the report JSON with evidence quotes. I have notes but need exact quotes. I should verify quotes from pages. Let me check what evidence pages are available. I have notes with quotes. But I need exact continuous quotes ≥20 chars from pdf pages.\n\nLet me recall evidence to get page text for reasoning (p.10, p.13), tool_use (p.23), multi_agent (p.46, p.47), outlook (p.51, p.52). I have limited requests left (6). Need efficient.\n\nLet me first write report.json using the quotes in notes, but I need to be confident they're exact. The notes claim exact quotes. Risk: quotes may be paraphrased. Better to recall a few evidence pages to confirm. But recall consumes a batch — evidence ids are delivered in batches. Let me try recall for the key pages.\n\nActually the evidence ids: ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2 (page 4), ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5 (page 5). Notes quote p.10, p.13, p.23, p.46, p.47, p.51, p.52. I don't have those evidence ids.\n\nI have 6 requests left, 34 used. Requests left 6. Hmm, each action costs a request? Let me plan: 1 request to recall pages (delivered next turn?), recall queues evidence. But \"batches are bounded and overflow remains pending\". This costs turns.\n\nAlternative: use read_pdf? Already called once; shouldn't call again.\n\nBetter: write report.json now with quotes from my notes, then pytest, then final. That's ~2 actions. But risk inaccurate quotes. The notes say \"p.10 exact\" etc., which suggests earlier I had the actual page text. I'll trust them but also could verify via recall if extra budget.\n\nLet me do recall of a compact set of pages to confirm quotes: pages 10, 13, 23, 46, 47, 51, 52. That's one recall call; evidence delivered next turn. That's 2 requests (recall + read). Then write + pytest. Total ~4-5. Feasible within 6.\n\nBut recall requires evidence ids, which I don't have for those pages. recall(evidence_ids) queues ids from delivered Evidence headers. I only have ev ids for pages 4,5. The page text for others isn't available now. Hmm.\n\nGiven constraints, I'll construct the report from the notes, using quotes I recorded as exact. Then run pytest.\n\nLet me compose report JSON.\n\nCategories: \"英文数组，使用动词基本形式\" → reasoning/acting/interacting → verbs: \"reason\", \"act\", \"interact\". Evidence page 4 quote: \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other\". That's continuous from page 4 text? In delivered page 4 text: \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed\". Good, ≥20 chars.\n\nsearch_methods: google_scholar_search, snowballing — lower case with underscores. Page 5 quote: \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\" Exact from delivered text (line break \"on\\nAgentic LLM\" — merge whitespace ok). Good.\n\nreasoning: self_consistency_selection: \"majority voting\". Page 10 quote: \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\" Not verified in delivered evidence this turn but from note as exact. tot_search: [\"breadth_first\",\"depth_first\"]; quote p.13 about breadth-first and depth-first controller. The note gives a long quote: \"Here, an external control algorithm is created, that calls the model, each time with a different prompt, so that it follows a tree of reasoning steps. When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" That's long but within 1500.\n\ntool_use: toolformer_tools short forms: calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation_system, calendar? The format says \"使用 calculator、question_answering 这样的简写格式\". Translation system → translation? Hmm. Paper: \"a translation system\" short form \"translation\"? Guidance: \"答案接受论文中的常见等价名称，例如带 system 后缀的完整工具名及其简写\". So translation_system is acceptable maybe, but short form likely \"translation\". Similarly \"search engine\" → search. Question answering → question_answering. Ambiguous. The examples: calculator, question_answering. So they drop \"system\"? question_answering system → question_answering. So translation system → translation? and search engine → search_engine (no system suffix). Hmm. I'll use: calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation, calendar. Risk: if expected translation_system. \"带 system 后缀的完整工具名及其简写\" — acceptable equivalents. I'll pick translation_system? Actually the accepted answer likely list: calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation_system, calendar (shortened by removing \"a\"/\"system\"?). Hmm.\n\nSafest may be forms matching examples pattern: replace spaces with underscores, use short form. \"question-answering system\" → question_answering (system dropped). \"search engine\" → search_engine (engine kept, since it's a noun compound). \"translation system\" → translation. \"calendar\" → calendar. I'll go with translation.\n\ntoolbench_api_count: 16464.\n\nmulti_agent: camel_prompting: inception_prompting. Quote p.46: \"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea.\" ≥20 chars yes.\ngenerative_agents_evaluators: 100. Quote p.47: \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"\n\noutlook: agenda_topics: training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety. shared_foundations: reasoning, self_verification. Quote p.52: \"Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\" Good.\n\nAgenda topics quote from table p.51: continuous region including \"Topic Challenge Training Data ... Hallucination ... Agent Behavior ... Self reflection ... Safety\". Note's table quote includes all five names. Good.\n\noverview root: 200-600 chars Chinese.\n\nNow write report.json with expected_hash ca3d...\n\nLet me build JSON via Python dict and json.dumps. But writing a huge string in code — allowed? write_file(path, content, expected_hash). Content can be a variable built from dict. Fine.\n\nLet me construct."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8272,"completion_tokens":3845,"total_tokens":12117,"prompt_toke